  'ev-charger-installer-marketing-uk': ['Many EV charger enquiries are triggered by a car purchase, so being visible for local install searches at that moment matters more than broad awareness.', 'Separate pages for home chargers, workplace charging and installs for landlords or flats match different buyers and their very different questions.', 'A short survey form that collects photos of the fuse board and parking spot qualifies leads and speeds up accurate quotes.'],
