  'google-ads-agency-ireland': ['Google Ads for an Irish business works best with Ireland-specific targeting, keywords, ad copy and landing pages, rather than a UK campaign stretched across the border.', 'A remote, UK-based studio can set up, manage and report on Google Ads for Irish companies, working in the same time zone with your accounts held in your name.', 'Management is priced as a monthly retainer in pounds, with other currencies such as euro quoted on request, and ad spend is always paid separately to Google.'],
  'heat-pump-installer-marketing-uk': ['Heat pump buyers research for weeks, so pages that explain suitability, running costs, grants and the install process do more selling than any single advert.', 'Local SEO and a well-kept Google Business Profile win the high-intent searches, while tightly controlled Google Ads fill gaps in quieter months.', 'Trust is the deciding factor: show your accreditations accurately, explain the survey honestly and make booking a home assessment simple.'],
  'hot-tub-retailer-marketing-uk': ['Hot tub buying is seasonal and research-heavy, so plan content and ad budgets around the months when people start comparing, not just when they buy.', 'Model pages, honest running-cost explainers and installation guidance answer the questions that otherwise send buyers to cheaper online sellers.', 'Driving showroom visits and wet tests is usually the strongest goal for paid ads, because the in-person experience closes higher-value sales.'],
